391		Let $G_i=\LCS(\mathbf H_i, l_i, \Z_d)$, $i\in [n]$ be LCS games over $\Z_d$ with $\mathbf H_i=(H_i,V_i,E_i)$. We define their \emph{product LCS game} as $\prod_iG_i:= \LCS(\mathbf H, l, \Z_d)$, where $\mathbf H = (H,V,E)$ andbbb
392		\begin{align}
393		V &= \left(\bigsqcup_i V_i\right)\sqcup V_\text{prod}
394		&V_\text{prod} &= \set{v_{xy}\; x\in E_i, y\in E_j, i\neq j}
395		\\E &= \left(\bigsqcup_i E_i\right)\sqcup E_\text{prod}
396		&E_\text{prod} &= \set{e_{xy}\; x\in E_i, y\in E_j, i\neq j}
397		\end{align}
