   197		Suppose $\m P$ is a $\mathcal{P}_2^{\otimes 2}$-picture in which each generator and relation appears at most $m$ times. Then there is a $\G_2$-picture $\m P'$ witnessing the same equation in which each generator and relation appears at most $3m$ times.
